                "text": "At @RIKidsCount\u2019s annual Celebration of Children\u2019s Health & Well-Being, I discussed one of my priorities for our young people: mental health.\n\nWe still have work to do to combat stigma, reduce barriers to treatment & ensure the availability of providers for all who need help. https://t.co/AHbzC5doY5",
