                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Started under Bush 43, PEPFAR is a program with widespread bipartisan support that has saved millions of lives through the prevention and treatment of HIV/AIDS.\n\nA pause on PEPFAR \u00a0\u2014 even for a day \u2014 will have deadly results. \n\nMy colleagues and I are calling on @SecRubio to restore funding for this critical global health program immediately.",
